  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NJORD 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A team of students from Department of Ocean Engineering, Indian Institute of Technology Madras will participate in Njord 2024, taking place in Trondheim in August 2024. Objective is to provide the students exposure to autonomous ship building etc, building their capacity and developing a network of students and researchers in the ocean space.</narrative>
  </description>
